WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.157
Titrating heart failure medicines safely.

2
00:00:03.607 --> 00:00:08.669
Monitoring potassium, kidney function and blood pressure while reaching target doses.

3
00:00:09.119 --> 00:00:14.065
For reduced ejection fraction, four drug classes reduce mortality and admissions.

4
00:00:14.515 --> 00:00:17.684
Starting them early matters more than perfect sequencing.

5
00:00:18.134 --> 00:00:23.928
Check symptoms, weight, blood pressure, kidney function and potassium at each step of titration.

6
00:00:24.378 --> 00:00:28.522
An early review within two weeks of discharge reduces readmission.
